### Schedule API Tests - Improved Version
### This file now includes examples with proper User validation

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
### Zmieñ na rzeczywisty userId z bazy danych!
@userId = 5a5bc3b3-6a7c-49d8-8714-f0eeaeee0bf6
@scheduleId = 7bb24d4b-c9b5-44fd-8ce1-8f8ecf559ffe

### ===== STEP 1: POBRANIE ISTNIEJ¥CEGO USER_ID =====
### Uruchom to zapytanie aby dowiedzieæ siê jakie userId istniej¹ w bazie
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json

### Skopiuj ID jednego z u¿ytkowników i zast¹p @userId powy¿ej

### ===== STEP 2: TWORZENIE SCHEDULE'I =====

### CREATE Schedule - Main variant (pl218 world)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Daily Farm Schedule",
  "world": "pl218",
  "scheduleType": "Main"
}

### CREATE Schedule - Reconnaissance variant (pl219 world)
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Reconnaissance Mission",
  "world": "pl219",
  "scheduleType": "Reconaissance"
}

### CREATE Schedule - Fake attack
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedules
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Fake Attack Training",
  "world": "pl220",
  "scheduleType": "Fake"
}

### ===== STEP 3: POBIERANIE SCHEDULE'I =====

### GET all schedules for user
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json

### GET schedule by ID (zmieñ {{scheduleId}} na ID ze zwróconej odpowiedzi powy¿ej)
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{userId}}/{{scheduleId}}
Accept: application/json

### ===== STEP 4: AKTUALIZACJA I USUNIÊCIE =====

### UPDATE schedule - change to Reconnaissance
PUT {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Daily Farm Schedule",
  "world": "pl221",
  "scheduleType": "Reconaissance"
}

### DELETE schedule
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}

### ===== INSTRUKCJA =====
### 1. Uruchom GET /users - otrzymasz listê istniej¹cych u¿ytkowników
### 2. Skopiuj ID jednego z u¿ytkowników (pole "id")
### 3. Zast¹p @userId tym ID w zmiennej powy¿ej
### 4. Teraz mo¿esz testowaæ CREATE, GET, PUT, DELETE
### 5. Po ka¿dym CREATE skopiuj zwrócony "id" i podstaw do {{scheduleId}}

### Available World values: pl218, pl219, pl220, pl221, pl222, pl223
### Available ScheduleType values: Fake, Reconaissance, Main
